{"v":4,"catch":"為發射做準備!\n部署你的太空飛船，擊退外星人!","desc":"《SPACE CRUISER》是TAITO於1981年發售的射擊遊戲。\n玩家在公元 2100 年扮演太空巡洋艦船長的角色，在太空巡邏以確保地球和平。\n攔截敵人，越過小行星帶，在空間站為你的飛船加油！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-08-26","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.0GB / Switch 0.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ae47c88b9333d713ecc9f8e6501761e0d77d3746d1614d9414c21f4424f1ea00.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f2bda87e55385659919147092aaac20f97e4e228c4d7ae3097ed8a72d45b3aca.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6cf80d8df7829581146763145542659a834f40142ec4d2410e715ecbe23383cf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/25fdcdbe5a1fae8e5214629a286617ad090a61c51f65ea8b33b43a3de3d0f239.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3192c79705217beec3c216d52a2e95037adbd1a7dcd509307f4ee8a914720616.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7e0abf9d2b4e347b6b12dc4bc1dee86a187e8e3cfae1ad7b00d833bd5ce6798d.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b43015796000","dlc":[]}